# Canonical identity for this fork's sole author.
#
# The history records the same person under two author names and a bot
# committer. This file folds them into one identity so that git shortlog,
# git log --use-mailmap, and GitHub's contributor views are accurate.
#
# NOTE: git's mailmap applies to author and committer fields only. It does
# NOT rewrite Signed-off-by trailers, which live in the commit message body.
# This repository's history contains fabricated Signed-off-by names that no
# mailmap can correct; see CONTRIBUTING.md, "A defect in our own commit
# history", for the full account.

Ben De St Paer-Gotch <nebuk89@github.com> nebuk89 <nebuk89@github.com>
Ben De St Paer-Gotch <nebuk89@github.com> nebuk89 <nebuk89@users.noreply.github.com>
